			"Message": "fix(Output): Add IPC stubs for extension tips, MCP, sync, and language detection\n\nAdd missing stub handlers to TauriMainProcessService to prevent renderer crashes when VS Code code calls these services without Mountain handlers:\n\n- IExtensionTipsService: exeBasedRecommendations.ts calls .forEach() on the result, requiring array stubs (empty = no recommendations)\n- IMcpManagementService / IMcpWorkbenchManagement: mcpManagementIpc.ts calls .map() on server arrays, requiring array stubs\n- IUserDataSyncService: userDataSyncServiceIpc.ts destructures a [status, conflicts, lastSyncTime] tuple, requiring tuple stub\n- ILanguageDetectionService: iterates fileExtensions.extensions, requiring object stub with nested empty extensions array\n\nThese stubs return safe empty values that VS Code's workbench code can gracefully handle, preventing TypeError crashes in the renderer.",
			"SHA": "1452db402083b54d42dd76a6ab8ea6a45111f087"
		},
